     "Wang Lung"
    ],
    "speech": "I have thought to have a great market in the town where the big houses are, but I have not yet a place. There are some houses which the rich can buy but not the poor like me. I have asked many times of the great merchant Liu and he says that he can get me a place if I bring him the money. He says, 'Bring me a hundred pieces of silver and I will get you a place,' and I say, 'Well, and what will I do after that?'"
